# A whitelist, like 12tails-video's: everything at the top level is ignored unless it is listed here.
# Untracked by design: wardrobe_dist (the published copy, rebuilt by pipeline/wardrobe_publish.py), checks/, tto_config/,
# .superpowers/, any data folder set aside (wardrobe_data_old ...).
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/CLAUDE.md
!/NOTES.md
!/HANDOFF.md
!/wardrobe.cmd
!/pipeline/
!/plans/
!/wardrobe/
# wardrobe/data IS tracked since 2026-11-10 (user: "one repo for now"; it moved between the PCs as a tar through Google
# Drive before). A copy renamed aside (data_old, data-home, ...) stays out, and so does the office's repair of its damaged
# rip (bb_rip_fix: that PC only)
/wardrobe/data*/
!/wardrobe/data/
/wardrobe/data/bb_rip_fix/
__pycache__/
